  "description": "MCP server for GroupDocs.Comparison for .NET — compare two documents and produce a marked-up diff report with a change-count summary and a structured list of changes, analyze the differences as structured data without rendering a file, plus inspect source document info (file type, page count, dimensions). Supports PDF, Word, Excel, PowerPoint, ODT, RTF, TXT, HTML, and 30+ more formats. Exposes Compare, AnalyzeChanges and GetDocumentInfo tools to AI agents.",
